{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/260a3ba802049041be7bb8d417bb8fcb.poster.avif?t=1772617302\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/260a3ba802049041be7bb8d417bb8fcb.webm?t=1772617302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/260a3ba802049041be7bb8d417bb8fcb.mp4?t=1772617302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORK. DIE. REPEAT.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take a contract \u2192 choose how to handle encounters \u2192 salvage &amp; recycle \u2192 refit your fleet \u2192 return, settle the bill, and head out again for bigger risks and bigger rewards.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/6ab178ddeaaf575d2cdd0283c49c98c5.avif?t=1772617302\" width=616 height=144 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a lone ship run\u2014it\u2019s <strong>fleet deployment and tactical decision-making</strong>. Let the AI handle routine combat, or take manual control to focus fire and reposition for an edge:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Formation &amp; positioning</strong> shape your damage coverage and survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Target focus</strong> changes the pace of fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight when you must\u2014retreat when you should</strong> (getting home is part of winning)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/6beb71c4acb715d6f94726b2453bf3d0.poster.avif?t=1772617302\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/6beb71c4acb715d6f94726b2453bf3d0.webm?t=1772617302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/6beb71c4acb715d6f94726b2453bf3d0.mp4?t=1772617302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/5263af643539f54132408a2b6d66ec68.poster.avif?t=1772617302\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/5263af643539f54132408a2b6d66ec68.webm?t=1772617302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/5263af643539f54132408a2b6d66ec68.mp4?t=1772617302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/d5f5702db10be1bf25d12c6da6f105f5.avif?t=1772617302\" width=616 height=144 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelite resource strategy: salvage, rebuild, repeat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sortie is a gamble. Routes, battles, and encounters come with different rewards and costs. Winning isn\u2019t enough\u2014you must manage <strong>expenses, attrition, and salvage value</strong>, because what you bring back is how you grow stronger.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Module builds</strong>: swap better modules on the spot\u2014power spikes you can feel immediately</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Route gambling</strong>: safer paths offer stability; riskier ones can yield rarer modules and bigger payouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cut your losses</strong>: retreating is a strategy\u2014but deductions are real, and the settlement will tell the story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/d597a04253708fda486eb297ae4fc2b9.poster.avif?t=1772617302\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/d597a04253708fda486eb297ae4fc2b9.webm?t=1772617302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/d597a04253708fda486eb297ae4fc2b9.mp4?t=1772617302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/8868c9b64d2551b890edf62772e2fa78.avif?t=1772617302\" width=616 height=144 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dark humor, written into the rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The galaxy\u2019s glory belongs to \u201ccivilization.\u201d The mess is for field agents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You\u2019ll face absurd incidents, faction politics, and corporate bureaucracy\u2014where dark humor isn\u2019t just dialogue, it\u2019s the system itself:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you think you\u2019ve \u201cpaused\u201d\u2026 and it turns out you just triggered another procedure and another cost</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you win the battle\u2026 then watch your earnings get sliced before they reach your pocket</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, the enemy isn\u2019t only enemy fire. It\u2019s also the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/e46af35fab7cd208693cd4b2ed2053f7.poster.avif?t=1772617302\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/e46af35fab7cd208693cd4b2ed2053f7.webm?t=1772617302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129930/extras/e46af35fab7cd208693cd4b2ed2053f7.mp4?t=1772617302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Proof of Dedication","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3129930/ea6144c00c9eadbc5e461aaac19d49df66f8b395.jpg"},{"name":"Griping","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3129930/ec868ddc24ca8f5b18a5b2cb31c99b0f102293cc.jpg"},{"name":"Get Started","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3129930/7d3911b2caadbaa2e95d96f8acde5c35b8c7c8e6.jpg"},{"name":"Strategical Retreat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3129930/415debef07d0911a089e58b69831bdc37795c725.jpg"},{"name":"Fight to the Last","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3129930/61b509f72bba1eb6196241f6e4b1cf4a80d62f96.jpg"},{"name":"Mercy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3129930/35c62ecb3a9b2dcb2cb648c072cfeb0375bdd8e7.jpg"},{"name":"Interception","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3129930/2bf7a7b0c83c899f2ac63707f4a85c767dcf91b8.jpg"},{"name":"Slash Care